OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over gun found at rat
OL,4,Ainfested nursery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with firearm and
OL,7,Fdrug offences after a gun was found at
OL,8,Fa nursery which had been closed down
OL,9,Fover a rat infestation.
OL,11,FThe weapon was found at Mini Fingers
OL,12,Fnursery on Liverpool Road in Irlam,
OL,13,FSalford, on Wednesday, days after it
OL,14,Fwas shut down by environmental health.
OL,16,FGreater Manchester Police previously
OL,17,Fsaid the investigation was unrelated to
OL,18,Fthe nursery's closure.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
